WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,526
Oh no!

2
00:00:01,476 --> 00:00:06,738
Every morning Maya carries boxes from Sammy to Eddie, one by one!

3
00:00:06,738 --> 00:00:10,607
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

4
00:00:10,607 --> 00:00:13,131
This is Episode 38.

5
00:00:13,131 --> 00:00:17,774
And a parcel from the old house on the ground has nowhere to land.

6
00:00:17,774 --> 00:00:20,048
Here comes the arch pipe.

7
00:00:20,048 --> 00:00:22,202
One foot by Sammy.

8
00:00:22,202 --> 00:00:24,250
One foot by Eddie.

9
00:00:24,250 --> 00:00:26,845
Maya turns the wheel once.

10
00:00:26,845 --> 00:00:29,917
Boxes slide through by themselves.

11
00:00:29,917 --> 00:00:32,179
Nobody carries a thing.

12
00:00:32,179 --> 00:00:34,929
And here is the old brass tube.

13
00:00:34,929 --> 00:00:38,667
The ground house sends mail the way it always did.

14
00:00:38,667 --> 00:00:39,988
Whoosh!

15
00:00:39,988 --> 00:00:43,095
It lands right in Sammy's arms.

16
00:00:43,095 --> 00:00:53,750
That is AppFlow and Amazon MQ: AppFlow moves data between apps on its own, and MQ lets old systems keep sending messages the way they always did.

17
00:00:53,750 --> 00:00:57,952
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

